<section id="A3" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix C </span>Prompt Templates</h2>

<div id="A3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">We provide the synthesizer and student-solving templates below. Both mathematical
and code question synthesis use fixed instructions without persona conditioning
or few-shot example problems. In the templates, <span id="A3.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">{q}</span> denotes the question
to be solved. Line wrapping is adjusted for readability.</p>
</div>
