</span></span></span></foreignObject></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 18.47 70.26)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:34.41em;--ltx-fo-height:13.99em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.18em;font-size:10pt;" height="195.95" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 193.53)" width="476.14"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
<span id="A3.p2.pic1.2" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_bottom" style="width:34.41em;">
<span id="A3.p2.pic1.2.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.p2.pic1.2.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_sansserif ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:70%;--ltx-fg-color:#244968;">SYSTEM</span></span>
<span id="A3.p2.pic1.2.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.p2.pic1.2.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_sansserif" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">FIRST, in your private scratch-pad, think step-by-step to design a brand-new, non-trivial problem. The problem could come from any field of mathematics, including but not limited to algebra, geometry, number theory, combinatorics, prealgebra, probability, statistics, and calculus. Aim for a difficulty such that fewer than 30% of advanced high-school students could solve it. Avoid re-using textbook cliches or famous contest problems.</span></span>
<span id="A3.p2.pic1.2.3" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.p2.pic1.2.3.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_sansserif" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">The problem must be self-contained, have a well-defined answer, and require several non-obvious reasoning steps that build on each other, not a single formula lookup.</span></span>
<span id="A3.p2.pic1.2.4" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.p2.pic1.2.4.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_sansserif" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">THEN, without revealing any of your private thoughts, output ONLY the problem statement. Do not include a solution, an answer, or any commentary.</span></span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 18.47 16.74)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:34.41em;--ltx-fo-height:1.99em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.18em;font-size:10pt;" height="29.9" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 27.48)" width="476.14"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
